    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili joŋado Yordan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odikin maŋic Yosuwa oay to cako woth wok Sitim kodi Joisiraili je to jotundo Yordan. Joketho kambi pajo kenyo mafodi jok'oŋado Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndelo adek orumo jotel jowotho thoko kambi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to jowodho or ri ji ni, “Ka wineno jocway ri Were pa Levi jotiŋo Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth Were mewin, nyaka to wiwok i kabedo mewin. Luw win, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋey nyaka winyal ŋeyo royo ma wiripo luwo, kole fodi wikiluwo royo me con mere. Kucel thwolo bino bedo i dier win kodi Kakan ma Cikirok, boro ma romo kilomita acel, wikiri wicore cegin gine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka to Yosuwa waco ri ji ni, “Loki win kwo mewin maleŋ; kole Rwoth dikin latimo gir'aura i dier win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa owaco ri jocway ri Were i wi migam ni, “Kwany win Kakan ma Cikirok, aka wikadhi ruwaŋ ji.” Ameno to jokwanyo Kakan ma Cikirok to jokadho ruwaŋ ji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Yosuwa ama: Ndelo me abino cako lokin ŋatadwoŋ i waŋ Isiraili gipi, ŋey jowonyal ŋeyo ni alabedo kodin paka cango abedo gi Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere in, wodhi or ri jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jotiŋo Kakan ma Cikirok, “Ka witundo dho dhok pi ma Yordan, iripo cungo liŋ i Yordan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yosuwa owaco ri Joisiraili ni, “Core win cegin aka wiwinji wac pa Rwoth Were mewin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa owaco ni, “Gi gime wibino ŋeyo ni Were makwo nitie i dier win, aka go k'obedi ma k'ogweyo woko ruwaŋ win Jokanan, Johiti, Johivi, Joperiz, Jogagas, Joamor kodi Joyebus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni win, Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth ma piny gipi kidho luwo ruwaŋ win donjo i Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo pama yer win cwo apar g'ario wok kwoŋ nonin ma Isiraili, acel kwoŋ kisi nono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka par tiendi jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jotiŋo Kakan pa Rwoth, Rwoth ma piny gipi, ogey pi ma Yordan, pi ma mol wok yumalo bino ŋadere woko, to jocungo i kidhur acel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ji joay i wemin pajo ma kidho ŋado Yordan, jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jotiŋo Kakan ma Cikirok oyido jonitie ruwaŋ ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Yordan opoŋ de oy kiri malo i coŋino mere hongo je ma keco. Ameno munyo joma jotiŋo Kakan jotundo Yordan, aka par tiendi jocway ri Were i migam ma jotiŋo Kakan oluthere i thengi pi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pi ma mol wok malo ocungo liŋ, ka ay malo i wic acel bor swa i Adam, tindi madwoŋ macegin gi Zarethan, kareno meno ma jomol kadho i nam ma Araba, nam ma Cumbi, oyido oŋadi jo kicutho. Kenyo to ji joŋado kama ŋiyere gi Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Joisiraili oyido joŋado kam'othwo, Jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jotiŋo Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth jocungo kam'othwo i dier Yordan, cuka nono parom jotieko ŋado Yordan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
